        "duration_seconds": 49.291,
        "asr_text": "Are tiny handbags really back? Fashion coverage gives us a more interesting answer. They are visible again, but they have not pushed big bags off the stage. In Spring-Summer 2025, fashion coverage said small bags were being replaced by large totes and useful doctor-style bags. For Fall-Winter 2025, it again reported that most handbags shown were roomy enough for everyday use. So a simple tiny bags-are-back story does not fit. The runway picture became more divided. Fashion coverage saw very large and very small bags in the same 2025 season. Coach showed large coin purse clutches, while Fendi showed tiny leather bags.",
