        "asr_text": "This same pattern appeared in 2026: small pouches appeared at Prada, Loewe, Miu Miu, and Valentino. At the same time, large bags appeared at Celine, Altuzarra, Totem, Stella McCartney, and Kalmeyer. Some Fall/Winter 2026 shoulder bags from Chanel, Miu Miu, and Bottega Veneta were even large enough for a laptop. Mini bags also received strong attention from fashion editors. One fashion magazine called them a major Fall 2026 styling direction, but another offered a more mixed view, saying that autumn was bringing back larger bags while still keeping smaller clutches and top-handle bags in the picture. One trend company also reported a 152% rise in retail adoption for oversized clutches in 2026. That is a company estimate, but it adds an important counterpoint: The clearest answer is this: tiny bags are gaining attention in some fashion spaces, but they are not winning everywhere. Small and large bags are appearing side by side.",
